	desc = "A creature dwelling in the depths of Grimoria's swamps, by nature occupying an ambiguous place between mortals, spirits, and gods. She is formally unrecognized as part of any pantheon, rejected by the Church of the Ten as an impostor and heretical anomaly, yet possesses a genuine — if diminished — spark of divinity. The Mossmother herself considers this recognition undeservedly limited: the gods who occupy the thrones of Order refuse to acknowledge her as their equal. This shall not go unpunished."
